OL,3,GNEWSAPraying mantis breeding could be
OL,4,AUK mainland first
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discovery of a species of praying
OL,7,Fmantis nymphs could be the first
OL,8,Fevidence of the insects breeding on the
OL,9,FUK mainland, according to a wildlife
OL,10,Ftrust.
OL,12,FCornwall Wildlife Trust said 10
OL,13,FEuropean praying mantis nymphs were
OL,14,Frecorded at Truro School, which David
OL,15,FMcKeown, the school's head of boarding,
OL,16,Fsaid was a "remarkable and very
OL,17,Fsurprising" find.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
