OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1787320542
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPraying mantis breeding could be
OL,4,AUK mainland first
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Fox, data and evidence officer at
OL,7,FEnvironmental Records Centre for
OL,8,FCornwall and the Isles of Scilly, said
OL,9,Fno other species of mantis had been
OL,10,Festablished in the county or the rest
OL,11,Fof the UK.
OL,13,F"As global temperatures continue to
OL,14,Frise, we can expect more exotic species
OL,15,Fto arrive in the UK from southern
OL,16,FEurope," Fox added.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
